<title>USA: DXP to trade on Nasdaq National Market.</title>
<headline>DXP to trade on Nasdaq National Market.</headline>
<text>
<p>HOUSTON, Texas, June 27 (Reuetr) - DXP enterprises Inc said Fiday it received approval to list its common stock on Nasdaq's National Market under the symbol &quot;DXPE&quot; as of July 2.</p>
<p>The distributor of industrial operating supplies on June 5 said it bought two privately-held suppliers for $5.2 million in cash, 280,000 shares and $7.7 million in assumed debt. DXP shares closed at 6-1/4 Thursday.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
